Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.50,-1:59:59.60,TitleJa,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,575)}本屋での午後
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:01:16.28,Header,,0,0,0,,H003  •  第3文型 [SVO]
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.20,English,,0,0,0,,The library had a quiet atmosphere that afternoon.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.20,0:00:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,I picked up a small essay collection and opened the first chapter.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.48,0:00:15.06,English,,0,0,0,,The author gently described small discoveries in daily life.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.30,0:00:28.54,English,,0,0,0,,In one paragraph he expressed a memory; in another he openly described the desires of his youth.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.54,0:00:33.46,English,,0,0,0,,The writing strongly appealed to me and held my attention.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.46,0:00:41.74,English,,0,0,0,,The style was as calm as a philosophy book, yet something in it inspired me.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.70,0:00:48.06,English,,0,0,0,,I glanced out of the window, then returned to the page.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.06,0:00:54.70,English,,0,0,0,,The mind that had composed these sentences was quiet, but it was full of passion.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.70,0:00:57.78,English,,0,0,0,,Outside, a small child ran past.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.78,0:01:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,I watched him with curiosity.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.08,0:01:03.62,English,,0,0,0,,Then I continued reading.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.80,0:01:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,Words carry us beyond time.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.04,0:01:16.08,English,,0,0,0,,Today, I preferred this one book to everything else.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.58,0:01:21.64,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,465)}H003  
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.58,0:01:21.64,TitleJa,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,575)}本屋での午後
